tant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Zn5qnisboa-kU8DF9Lv_SyQ34Vh_DG6gKwBd0X0nHNAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWhttps://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/jul/21/splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-switch-2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SculwtJDi2LHK7JSrh9RazLnDWwleQQOAuQ7C19eJ9Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9https://newscable-source-broker.invalid/activitypub/actorƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;LYi4k8EX9Cp5jNPka3wa1XYTccXpfKcVOZVk1DQ1EVMƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;neavcDhsdzU1D0LFlYQhrGnCMeBXG0uneRbSGsSWR90ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWhttps://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/jul/21/splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-switch-2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jw9uDpZAMXYx6G7PqnyuKViRr14AaDxdPnWgwU1ySZAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyÈ<p><strong>Nintendo Switch 2</strong><br>The single-player offshoot of the quirky and colourful multiplayer series is disappointingly run-of-the-mill</p><p>Splatoon is among Nintendoâ€™s most ingenious inventions of the last decade: a series of shooting games whose paint-splattered turf war nature means being bad at shooting is just as valuable as â€“ if not more so than â€“ being good. It is also blessed with an abundance of personality, with vibrant characters, a richly imagined world, and a hipness that the competition can only dream of achieving. Unfortunately, Splatoon Raiders makes it difficult to remember all of this.</p><p>The first spinoff in the ink-soaked franchise, Splatoon Raiders is advertised as a single player-focused entry in this primarily multiplayer series. While this is true enough â€“ one can play through the entire game solo just fine â€“ Raiders is clearly best enjoyed cooperatively with up to three others. Players start each session on a hideout ship where they can upgrade their equipment and tweak their play style before heading out on bite-sized repeatable missions, and this structure is tailor-made for teaming up with friends or helping out strangers (the game lets you do either), as each person works towards creating their ultimate squid-kid avatar of chaos.</p><p>Splatoon Raiders is out 23 July; Â£41.99</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/jul/21/splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-switch-2">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IU70pem4NYIz3Hh0d_gvyn6GSdfynDeTviqJQ8GVudsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;epykIDLvalAM5Zlbz6-nDC4pnQZIPzPIHlCqCl1HuXMƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IdUdbzsSFzhQLwuYNwzSbyGHAEYzWsdQ1fn7U588b_8ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;p8VvAblLq70Oc-jR5WW1vgE3BmD-T4u4I--Md5H00Osƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;T9dJqGb5AyG2k5InGa__LyBepphHmszFWOxmvb87NKsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IS9ZhsFVEzlj7q186WgOHi82shgfFaN5Zp9M6_F-ezEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;hBgskLw51IdRVmG7jRE8lAI_lbEVukRIvWc4brN8K30ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Y0JwP8W8VnnfzAvjvxqqXhfAVXzIpa6YJDuA9tFNOHMƒdpairƒerightduni