heading out on bite-sized repeatable missions, and this structure is tailor-made for teaming up with friends or helping out strangers (the game lets you do either), as each person works towards creating their ultimate squid-kid avatar of chaos.</p><p>Splatoon Raiders is out 23 July; Â£41.99</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/jul/21/splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-switch-2">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xzcba_KKMsmbktc2guBqp39ZE0-3IWPec5BQDCJFS9sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxCSplatoon Raiders review â€“ Nintendoâ€™s inky shooter fades to greyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DZw6hMG_Rx2F0mTctyfGA7f0ukQ3zz-0vmPKWDzzIAQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;I8nMJ6DZAj7zZfDZANJ_FWFxr1uW5xjw5kBvUfcY92Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWhttps://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/jul/21/splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-switch-2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;H9MLapehufxf4pdtzGqsuOrqhQOmrUFENG2Rgq4EHy0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx=splatoon-raiders-review-nintendo-s-inky-shooter-fades-to-greyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;INhHPDHbIqtk8XsaSYkdTOuMHS2tsg0iKW8Gg8zQfmUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;myoMnjkdJy5_PntFiXWr4537tIaC9shtBInNbsaEXV4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcultureƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oMIh8-8A8A5waWpT95o2Um0BH-dKImuwIkzw2yHAZ24ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerig